A REQUEST FOR ATTRIBUTION

Because this software is in the public domain in the United States, we
cannot require attribution there, and this notice imposes no such legal
condition. We do, however, ask for it, and we would be grateful if you
honored the request.

If you use egi-pynetstation in published research, please cite it, and
please acknowledge the authors and the NIH Section on Functional Imaging
Methods in derived software and documentation. If this package supported
your work in a way that merits it, we would welcome hearing about it.
Attribution is how a small scientific software project demonstrates its
value and justifies its continued development, so the courtesy matters to
us even where the law does not compel it.

